[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1206","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0898","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 打印后台处理程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 打印后台处理程序（print spooler）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的后台打印请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致系统崩溃（拒绝服务）或获取系统级权限。该漏洞源于打印后台处理服务对用户提交的打印请求数据缺乏正确的边界检查，攻击者无需身份验证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0898"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-11-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-047 提供的补丁程序，禁用不必要的打印共享服务，限制对打印后台处理程序的网络访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T23:12:28Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-047","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ243649","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/768"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1200","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0896","title":"RealNetworks RealServer 管理工具缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealServer 管理工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向管理接口提交超长的用户名和密码，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在服务器上执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者可完全控制受影响的服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0896"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1999-11-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 RealNetworks RealServer 至修复版本，限制管理接口的访问来源 IP，避免将管理端口暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T23:02:18Z","references":["http://service.real.com/help/faq/servg260.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/767"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0887","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0887.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0887","title":"FTGate Web接口服务器 目录遍历漏洞","description":"FTGate Web接口服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过HTTP请求中的..（点点）序列读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0887"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-11-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级FTGate到修复此漏洞的版本，并对用户输入进行路径规范化校验，禁止..等目录遍历字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T10:49:23Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0887.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0636","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0636.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0843","title":"思科路由器NAT拒绝服务漏洞","description":"思科路由器NAT功能存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过向Telnet端口发送精心构造的FTP PORT命令，消耗路由器NAT会话资源，导致设备无法正常提供网络地址转换服务。该漏洞无需认证即可远程触发，影响所有运行NAT功能的思科路由器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0843"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响运行NAT功能的思科路由器。建议升级到不受影响的IOS版本或关闭不必要的NAT服务。受影响的用户可以联系思科获取更详细的修复信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0843"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0636.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0636.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0703","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0703.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0904","title":"Byte Fusion BFTelnet 1.1 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Byte Fusion BFTelnet 1.1 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统的 Telnet 服务发送超长用户名数据，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 BFTelnet 1.1 版本，攻击者只需网络可达即可利用，危害等级中危。目前官方已停止维护该产品，建议迁移至其他受支持的 Telnet 服务端软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0904"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:17Z","remediation":"Byte Fusion BFTelnet 1.1 已停止维护，建议立即迁移至 OpenSSH 或 Dropbear 等现代安全远程访问方案。如必须使用 Telnet 协议，可替换为 PuTTY Telnet 或同步升级至 BFTelnet 最新版本（若厂商仍提供）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙或 TCP Wrappers 中限制 telnet 端口（默认 23）仅允许受信 IP 段访问，并启用入侵检测规则监控异常长度的用户名字段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/771","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19596","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d25d3aeab9dc76030f155f9e202a4a7c294f86bf/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0904.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0904","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0904.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03324c0426abad4e55ae7c73b0bba67b9c87e4ea/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0904.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-98xh-mmww-3qq6/GHSA-98xh-mmww-3qq6.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/B/bftelnet.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/c9a52e4626751d35022482b24e543cc1d039fc40/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-09xx/CVE-1999-0904.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0703.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0677","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0677.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0885","title":"Computer Software Manufaktur Alibaba 2.0 多个CGI远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Computer Software Manufaktur Alibaba 2.0 Web 服务器存在多个 CGI 漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 URL 中注入管道符（|）等特殊字符，绕过输入验证执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Alibaba 2.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致服务器被完全控制。CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0885"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-03T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:15Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用已停止维护的 Alibaba 2.0 Web 服务器，迁移至 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx 等受支持的现代 Web 服务器。如无法立即迁移，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面过滤 URL 请求中的管道符 `|` 及其他 shell 元字符，并严格限制对服务器的网络访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/770","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=1999-11-01&msg=01BF261F.928821E0.kerb%40fnusa.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19595","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5546763f2cbf8b9d0a5bd1b009f21d50c3edeb8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0885.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0885","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0885.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1eab609178bfac1fdc1fdc37b8b4d17d9ecf98b7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0885.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rhxh-8j2v-c96c/GHSA-rhxh-8j2v-c96c.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/alibaba_get32.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/alibaba_tst.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/770/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0677.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0677.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0677.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1985","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1985.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1531","title":"IBM HomePagePrint 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IBM HomePagePrint 1.0.7 for Windows98J 中的 IMG_SRC HTML 标签处理存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当用户使用存在漏洞的浏览器访问恶意网站时，攻击者可通过在 HTML 页面中构造超长的 IMG_SRC 属性值触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受害者系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞无需用户交互即可触发，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响安装了 IBM HomePagePrint 1.0.7 的所有 Windows98J 系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1531"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:38Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载 IBM HomePagePrint 1.0.7，该产品已停止维护且不再提供补丁下载。可改用操作系统自带打印功能或其他受支持的打印软件替代。在 IE 浏览器中禁用 ActiveX 控件和插件执行（安全级别设为\"高\"），并可考虑升级操作系统至受支持版本以彻底消除该风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94157187815629&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7767.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/763","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19588","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/148999c8327bd04fe7e0fdad6195adf7b36060c6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1531.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1531","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1531.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/81cdfffcd86317dec05d7dfba407f93d96d91273/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1531.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gvcc-w8vm-24rf/GHSA-gvcc-w8vm-24rf.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1531.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153800_153900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e250aeb4-94ac-42ae-8a9c-bc2918488a72.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1985.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1985.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1985.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0742","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0742.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0948","title":"IRIX Solaris Turbolinux Canna输入系统 uum程序 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.5、Solaris 7.0 和 Turbolinux 4.2 系统中 Canna 输入系统的 uum 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理输入数据时未对缓冲区边界进行有效检查，本地攻击者可通过传入超长字符串触发溢出，进而执行任意代码并获取 root 权限。受影响系统包括 IRIX 6.5、Sun Solaris 7.0 及 Turbolinux 4.2，攻击者需要具备本地访问权限才能利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0948"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:23Z","remediation":"升级到已修复的 Canna 输入系统版本（IRIX 安装厂商安全补丁、Solaris 应用 Sun 推荐补丁簇、Turbolinux 升级至 4.2 后续修正包）。在无法立即打补丁前，可用 chmod 0755 移除 uum 程序的 setuid root 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/uum），或限制仅授权用户访问以缓解本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/757","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19582","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0f25967d744704fe14324ac10f2b57e945aed081/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0948.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0948","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0948.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82035e540ee415f78310ba979a19dffd78d3cfa2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0948.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8b1565557a8e0fb04634f0989d7e7dd7febd4847/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4c58-jfmw-xwq5/GHSA-4c58-jfmw-xwq5.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/757/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0948.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0742.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0741","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0741.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0947","title":"AN-HTTPd 1.2b CGI 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"AN-HTTPd 1.2b 自带的示例 CGI 脚本（test.bat、input.bat、input2.bat、envout.bat）未对用户输入进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过向这些脚本提交包含 shell 元字符（如管道符、分号等）的恶意请求，在服务器端执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 AN-HTTPd 1.2b 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0947"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:23Z","remediation":"立即删除 AN-HTTPd 安装目录下的 test.bat、input.bat、input2.bat、envout.bat 等示例 CGI 脚本，或升级到已修复该问题的最新版本。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器配置中禁止 .bat 文件作为 CGI 执行，并限制 CGI 目录仅允许必要的脚本运行。","stat