漏洞，攻击者可通过向 EMBED 标签中的 Text 变量传递超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致目标系统拒绝服务或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Yamaha MidiPlug 1.1 b-j 版本，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。攻击者需诱使用户访问包含恶意 EMBED 标签的页面以完成利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0946"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:23Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Yamaha MidiPlug 1.1 b-j 组件，通过控制面板\"添加/删除程序\"执行卸载。如无法卸载，手动删除注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Yamaha\\MidiPlug 项及浏览器插件目录中的 MidiPlug.dll 文件。临时缓解措施：在浏览器中禁用 ActiveX 控件执行权限，或使用组策略阻止 EMBED 标签加载 MidiPlug 插件。建议迁移至 Web MIDI API 等现代方案替代该过时组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94157187815629&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/760","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19585","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58316128f65d22a226717ff1f92ebf2058e46bc6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0946.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0946","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-0946.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4d2ed764072119c12b6f84e6ee4e0df62586a8c4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0946.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/95e6ff620d5494b93ba2234edfcf6a45187dc0a8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-56v6-ch4g-8qmx/GHSA-56v6-ch4g-8qmx.json","https://github.com/mitre/cti/blob/ea1adfe1a68ca3dcfe2dd883180b8cf10a988824/capec/2.1/attack-pattern/attack-pattern--8e403d18-af4e-4abd-bd38-0f99f74b4636.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0946.json","https://github.com/karimsammouri/capec_threat_modeling/blob/bec278e83cd0bd379b9e82a38e87b0be5fbd86d3/capec/46.csv","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0740.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0740.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0740.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0743","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0743.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0949","title":"Canna canuum 程序本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Canna 日文输入系统的 canuum 程序存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过 -k、-c 和 -n 选项传入超长参数触发溢出，由于 canuum 以 SUID root 权限安装，本地低权限用户可利用此漏洞获得 root 权限，完全控制系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0949"],"sources":["cve","avd","exploitdb"],"published":"1999-11-02T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-11-02T00:00:00Z","remediation":"临时缓解措施：移除 canuum 的 SUID 权限，执行 chmod u-s /usr/jp/canna/bin/canuum。长期修复：升级 Canna 输入系统至修复该缓冲区溢出的版本，或重新编译安装最新稳定版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0949","https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-1999-0949","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/758","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19583"],"poc_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19583"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0743.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1149","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1149.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1517","title":"Amanda 备份系统 runtar 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Amanda 备份系统中的 runtar 组件以 root 权限执行 tar 命令，由于未对用户指定的目标文件路径进行充分校验，导致本地攻击者可通过向 runtar 提供恶意文件路径实现任意文件读取或覆盖。该漏洞影响多种 UNIX 操作系统上的 Amanda 备份系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有系统本地访问权限方可利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1517"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:36Z","remediation":"立即升级 Amanda 至 2.6.2p2 及以上版本，该版本已限制 runtar 仅接受