服务器尝试执行这些数据文件时触发执行错误，导致文件内容以明文形式返回给远程攻击者，造成敏感数据（如用户帐号、密码哈希、配置信息）泄露。攻击者无需认证即可远程直接访问 cgi-bin 目录下的数据文件触发错误泄露，影响 Ultimate Bulletin Board 5.x 等版本，攻击者可直接获取敏感数据库文件，导致论坛用户数据泄露及后台接管风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0854"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:11Z","remediation":"建议升级 Ultimate Bulletin Board 至 5.0 或更高版本（已将数据文件移出 cgi-bin 目录）。若无法升级，请在 Web 服务器配置中禁止直接访问 cgi-bin 目录下的数据文件（如配置 Apache 的 ScriptAlias 仅执行 CGI 脚本，禁止静态文件访问），或将 UBB 数据文件目录移至 Web 根目录之外，并设置正确的文件系统权限限制 Web 进程读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=2000-02-22&msg=NDBBLKOPOLNKELHPDEFKIEPGCAAA.renzo.toma%40veronica.nl","http://www.ultimatebb.com/home/versions.shtml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2218edc43f34225d168835de417dff40749bef5/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0854.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0854","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0854.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2119b082f4927b0a9c902ed9fe95efb3b301cb81/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0854.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/645f3b3aab113438413618cef41319453f39d643/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g7j6-6964-v5qv/GHSA-g7j6-6964-v5qv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88370/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0854.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000843.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/44b40554314aa90807d3ddee27488f8c21cbcd40/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0653.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0653.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0615","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0615.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0829","title":"HP Secure Web Console 弱加密漏洞","description":"HP Secure Web Console 使用弱加密算法保护敏感数据传输，导致攻击者可通过中间人攻击或密文分析破解加密通信，窃取或篡改管理控制台传输的敏感信息（如管理凭据、配置数据）。该漏洞影响 HP Secure Web Console 早期版本，攻击者需处于网络中间位置（如同一局域网、ARP 欺骗、路由劫持）即可实施被动窃听或主动篡改攻击，利用弱加密算法的已知弱点（如密钥长度过短、算法已知漏洞）还原明文，进而获取管理控制台权限或窃取敏感配置数据。建议升级至修复版本并强制启用强加密套件（如 TLS 1.2+、AES-GCM）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0829"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:08Z","remediation":"升级到 HP Secure Web Console 1.0 之后修复该弱加密问题的固件版本（具体以 HP 官方发布的安全补丁为准）；在无法立即升级前，应禁用通过 Web Console 的远程明文管理访问，改为通过本地串口或带外管理网络访问，并在边界防火墙限制仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问 443 端口，同时强制启用强密码认证以缓解弱加密带来的信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0829","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8d7a64f7f43d1af6189d4f7237515b997555b777/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0829.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0829","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0829.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be19cdaa6196942fd4096a42a1eaf047a8584298/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0829.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j4xq-4vj2-xm3m/GHSA-j4xq-4vj2-xm3m.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1